---
source: crates/rustman-cli/src/tests.rs
expression: help
---
Create a new workspace (rustman.toml, a local environment and a sample request)

Usage: rustman init [OPTIONS] [DIR]

Arguments:
  [DIR]
          Directory to initialize (created if missing)
          
          [default: .]

Options:
      --bare
          Only create rustman.toml and the .gitignore entry, without sample files

      --color <WHEN>
          Color: auto (a terminal without NO_COLOR or TERM=dumb), always or never
          
          [default: auto]

  -v, --verbose...
          Log more on stderr: -v requests, -vv headers, -vvv everything (RUST_LOG, when set, replaces these levels)

  -h, --help
          Print help
